    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2175" root="برأ" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرَآءَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A writing of</i> [i. e. <i>conferring] immunity</i>
or <i>exemption:</i> from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرِئَ مِنَ الدَّيْنِ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العَيْب</span>, of
which it is the inf. n.: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرَاآتٌ</span>, with medd:
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرَاوَاتٌ</span> is [pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرَاةٌ</span>, and both of these are] vulgar.
(Mgh.)

